{
 "brief": "Hundreds of mourners gathered Friday in the village of Sawiya, northeast of Hebron, to bury Karim Sund Shalaldeh, a 17-year-old killed by settlers, Shehab Wire reported. The youth was shot in Khirbet Hamroush, a remote area in the occupied territory.\n\nThe funeral procession began at Aliah Government Hospital and moved toward the family home in Sawiya. Large crowds participated in the funeral rites for the teenager, whose death marked another fatal incident involving Israeli settlers in the West Bank.",
